{"title": "Youths Detained in Goa Over Support for Jailed Activist", "summary": "Two youths were detained in Panaji, Goa, following their alleged support for jailed activist Umar Khalid. The youths had gathered at Azad Maidan and marched to the Police Headquarters demanding his release. Following the detention, those who had gathered at Azad Maidan continued their protest. The police claimed that the youths were detained under Section 151 of the Code of Criminal Procedure. The opposition alleged that the government was suppressing dissent. The government said that it was taking necessary steps to maintain law and order in the state.", "summary_points": ["Two youths were detained in Panaji, Goa, following their alleged support for jailed activist Umar Khalid."], "title_hi": "", "summary_hi": "", "summary_points_hi": [], "framing": {}, "framing_hi": {}, "topic": "Society", "region": "India", "image_url": "https://th-i.thgim.com/public/incoming/c33ike/article71268598.ece/alternates/LANDSCAPE_1200/PTI05_22_2026_000097B.jpg", "sources": [{"source": "The Hindu", "owner": "The Hindu", "lean": "left", "language": "en", "url": "https://www.thehindu.com/news/national/goa/two-youths-detained-in-panaji-over-support-for-jailed-activist-umar-khalid/article71268579.ece", "headline": "Two youths detained in Panaji over support for jailed activist Umar Khalid"}, {"source": "Deccan Herald", "owner": "Deccan Herald", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivgFBVV95cUxOdEJWV1poeHRVRlZOd25uZU1JZWJNZ0xRSXBpMElPN292ZEV5ZWVVM2xiVjQwUHpBRUZVdUh0VVNveGdPTHRoSVZXUW5jLTN6VXBvSi1qTk00Nl91LVNuYUh6SFgzTGthZkJqQU5CUDFjTVlaMzJfcEZrSmJxSUJ6WWttWko2R2RmT1g3SkIwdDZzLXJ6V0dMNjZiajVxV3pUZ2tZVU5GOEV0bVVpMUk2dy1wMlBPTnZTSXRheC1R?oc=5", "headline": "Two youths detained in Panaji over 'support' for jailed activist Umar Khalid"}, {"source": "The Pioneer", "owner": "The Pioneer", "lean": "right", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipw